ound-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">프로그램3</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">갇힌 골짜기</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">143분</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">프로그램4</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">세 번의 무</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">78분</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">프로그램5</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">그의 아파트에서</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">70분</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">프로그램6</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 285px; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">소나기가 오기 직전 / 센자 모스트라 / 헛된 출발 / 세계 일주 두 번 / 백야 / 마지막 숨결 / 인 메모리엄 / 웰컴 / 파장을 기억하며</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor